  "goodToKnow": "Outen, borrowed from English, means to out someone, and sich outen means to come out, especially about sexual orientation: Berlin's mayor Klaus Wowereit famously came out in 2001, and footballer Thomas Hitzlsperger in 2014. Humorously, sich als Schlagerfan outen means to admit a guilty pleasure. Das Coming-out is the noun. Regular: outete, geoutet."
